TI  - Perspectives of Policy Makers and Service Users Concerning the Implementation of eHealth in Sweden: Interview Study.
AU  - Neher M
AU  - Nygårdh A
AU  - Broström A
AU  - Lundgren J
AU  - Johansson P
PY  - 2022
T2  - Journal of medical Internet research
VL  - 24
