TI  - Implementation of eHealth and AI integrated diagnostics with multidisciplinary digitized data: are we ready from an international perspective?
AU  - Bukowski M
AU  - Farkas R
AU  - Beyan O
AU  - Moll L
AU  - Hahn H
AU  - Kiessling F
AU  - Schmitz-Rode T
