TI  - Leadership's role in conflict management during health information technology adoption decisions: qualitative study.
AU  - Damali U
AU  - Ross W
AU  - Holst T
AU  - Daly D
PY  - 2025
T2  - Leadership in health services (Bradford, England)
VL  - 38
