TI  - Stop the Divide: Facilitators and Barriers to Uptake of Digital Health Interventions Among Socially Disadvantaged Populations.
AU  - Price-Haywood EG
AU  - Arnold C
AU  - Harden-Barrios J
AU  - Davis T
PY  - 2023
T2  - Ochsner journal
VL  - 23
IS  - 1
