TI  - Lessons learned from the implementation of remote control for the interoperability standard ISO/IEEE11073-20601 in a standard weighing scale.
AU  - Barrón-González HG
AU  - Martínez-Espronceda M
AU  - Trigo JD
AU  - Led S
AU  - Serrano L
PY  - 2016
