TI  - Quantifying cervical cancer radiotherapy care gap: Baseline assessment prior to implementation of a digital Health App.
AU  - Yorke AA
AU  - Muramuzi A
AU  - Lin LL
AU  - Awusa K
AU  - Kibudde S
AU  - Twum PT
AU  - Yorke CK
AU  - Ford EC
PY  - 2026
T2  - Technical innovations & patient support in radiation oncology
