TI  - A Self-help Tool to Facilitate Implementation of eHealth Initiatives in Health Care (E-Ready): Formative Evaluation.
AU  - Dannapfel P
AU  - Thomas K
AU  - Chakhunashvili A
AU  - Melin J
AU  - Trolle Lagerros Y
PY  - 2022
T2  - JMIR formative research
VL  - 6
