TI  - Influence of eHealth literacy on acceptance of healthcare services with risks in China: chain-mediating effect of general risk propensity and self-efficacy.
AU  - Chen J
AU  - Chen X
AU  - Tang Z
AU  - Lei L
AU  - Zhan Y
