TI  - Implementation of an electronic health record system during global surgical outreach: A prospective evaluation of success and sustainability.
AU  - Gatto AP
AU  - Atkin D
AU  - Tapia JC
AU  - Lowenberg M
AU  - Kamal RN
AU  - Shapiro LM
PY  - 2024
T2  - World journal of surgery
VL  - 48
