TI  - Implementation science evaluation of an eHealth pediatric primary-care overweight and obesity intervention using the RE-AIM evaluation framework.
AU  - Yudkin JS
AU  - Jungbauer RM
AU  - Allicock MA
AU  - Barlow SE
PY  - 2026
