TI  - The SMILe integrated care model in allogeneic SteM cell TransplantatIon faciLitated by eHealth: a protocol for a hybrid effectiveness-implementation randomised controlled trial.
AU  - De Geest S
AU  - Valenta S
AU  - Ribaut J
AU  - Gerull S
AU  - Mielke J
AU  - Simon M
AU  - Bartakova J
AU  - Kaier K
