TI  - Determinants of consent for electronic health information exchange: an observational retrospective study.
AU  - Keuper J
AU  - Hek K
AU  - van Tuyl LHD
AU  - Batenburg R
AU  - Verheij R
PY  - 2025
T2  - Health research policy and systems
VL  - 23
