TI  - Systematic review of mHealth and digital health interventions to improve childhood vaccination uptake in 19 Sub-Saharan African countries.
AU  - Bhattacharya A
AU  - Mark-Uchendu C
AU  - Hansen C
AU  - Evans J
PY  - 2025
T2  - PloS one
VL  - 20
