TI  - Developing electronic health record-based measures of the 4Ms to support implementation and evidence generation for Age-Friendly Health Systems.
AU  - Thombley RL
AU  - Rogers SE
AU  - Adler-Milstein J
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of the American Geriatrics Society
VL  - 72
