TI  - Feasibility and Implementation of a Digital Health Intervention Electronic Patient-Reported Outcomes-Based Platform for Telemonitoring Patients With Breast Cancer Undergoing Chemotherapy.
AU  - de Oliveira Rodrigues DD
AU  - Ribeiro Paiva BS
AU  - Lacerda DC
