TI  - Patients' and healthcare providers' perceptions in outpatient palliative cancer care services at a tertiary care hospital in Sri Lanka: prospects for adoption of a digital health intervention.
AU  - Deduwela RS
AU  - Athauda LK
AU  - Sirribaddana PA
PY  - 2026
