TI  - The evaluation of a lean healthcare concept to improve the implementation of Digital Health innovations in secondary health care: a qualitative study within a Dutch hospital setting.
AU  - Kellner HA
AU  - Edelman ER
AU  - van Eldik N
AU  - Hunen P
AU  - Spreeuwenberg M
PY  - 2024
T2  - BMC health services research
VL  - 24
