TI  - Designing for implementation: user-centered development and pilot testing of a behavioral economic-inspired electronic health record clinical decision support module.
AU  - Chokshi SK
AU  - Belli HM
AU  - Troxel AB
AU  - Blecker S
AU  - Blaum C
AU  - Testa P
AU  - Mann D
