TI  - Implementation factors affecting the large-scale deployment of digital health and well-being technologies: A qualitative study of the initial phases of the 'Living-It-Up' programme.
AU  - Agbakoba R
AU  - McGee-Lennon M
AU  - Bouamrane MM
AU  - Watson N
AU  - Mair FS
PY  - 2016
T2  - Health informatics journal
VL  - 22
