TI  - Sociodigital Determinants of eHealth Literacy and Related Impact on Health Outcomes and eHealth Use in Korean Older Adults: Community-Based Cross-Sectional Survey.
AU  - Kyaw MY
AU  - Aung MN
AU  - Koyanagi Y
AU  - Moolphate S
AU  - Aung TNN
