TI  - Primary care physicians' attitudes to the adoption of electronic medical records: a systematic review and evidence synthesis using the clinical adoption framework.
AU  - O'Donnell A
AU  - Kaner E
AU  - Shaw C
AU  - Haighton C
PY  - 2018
T2  - BMC medical informatics and decision making
VL  - 18
