TI  - Determinants of and Willingness to Use and Pay for Digital Health Technologies Among the Urban Elderly in Hangzhou, China.
AU  - Yang K
AU  - Li Y
AU  - Qi H
PY  - 2023
T2  - Risk management and healthcare policy
