TI  - Determinants influencing medication-related alert handling in the electronic health record: A systematic review and meta-analysis.
AU  - Raven K
AU  - Zhang J
AU  - Vagliano I
AU  - Jaspers MW
AU  - Peute LW
AU  - Medlock S
PY  - 2025
T2  - International journal of medical informatics
