TI  - Barriers to electronic medical record implementation: a comparison between ophthalmology and other surgical specialties in Canada.
AU  - Park JSY
AU  - Sharma RA
AU  - Poulis B
AU  - Noble J
PY  - 2017
T2  - Canadian journal of ophthalmology. Journal canadien d'ophtalmologie
VL  - 52
