TI  - Exploring Factors Affecting Voluntary Adoption of Electronic Medical Records Among Physicians and Clinical Assistants of Small or Solo Private General Practice Clinics.
AU  - Or C
AU  - Tong E
AU  - Tan J
AU  - Chan S
PY  - 2018
T2  - Journal of medical systems
VL  - 42
