TI  - Ensuring Effective Care Transition Communication: Implementation of an Electronic Medical Record-Based Tool for Improved Cancer Treatment Handoffs Between Clinic and Infusion Nurses.
AU  - Pandya C
AU  - Clarke T
AU  - Scarsella E
AU  - Alongi A
